#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:1
#: be404bb574444e28a3f5e8d8dbf7a947
msgid "Gateway Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Gateway Troubleshooting"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:3
#: 2257b528ce1d4b06afa473aa0ad274e4
msgid ""
"Confirm `FFED_QLC_GATEWAY_ROOT` points to the `fnpqnn_gateway_MVP` "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"Confirm `FFED_QLC_GATEWAY_ROOT` points to the `fnpqnn_gateway_MVP` "
"repository."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:4
#: 44d1fcfa7c07434c80031311f4b0e797
msgid "Confirm `fnpqnn_gateway_mvp/algoquest_companion.py` is present."
msgstr "Confirm `fnpqnn_gateway_mvp/algoquest_companion.py` is present."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:5
#: a622c6470ae847259404eb1a5951eca6
msgid ""
"Call `/api/v1/health/live`; `200` confirms the FfeD-QLC process is alive."
msgstr ""
"Call `/api/v1/health/live`; `200` confirms the FfeD-QLC process is alive."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:6
#: 5e70348bf1c9429fa02ea15435940166
msgid ""
"Call `/api/v1/health/ready`; `503` means the mandatory Gateway contract is "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Call `/api/v1/health/ready`; `503` means the mandatory Gateway contract is "
"unavailable."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:7
#: 4f56da98477542779453e992b573e1b4
msgid ""
"Never bypass readiness by manufacturing a session in the browser or SQLite."
msgstr ""
"Never bypass readiness by manufacturing a session in the browser or SQLite."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:9
#: 90b67b7238ab43c0b2e8e9ab1f899ccc
msgid ""
"The adapter imports the reviewed Gateway contract module and invokes its "
"validator. It does not read `.env`, browser state, provider cookies or API "
"keys."
msgstr ""
"The adapter imports the reviewed Gateway contract module and invokes its "
"validator. It does not read `.env`, browser state, provider cookies or API "
"keys."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:11
#: 50c8d72f30184872a47f35ccba0c9f47
msgid ""
"Compose supplies `../fnpqnn_gateway_MVP` as a named BuildKit context and "
"copies only its Python package into `/gateway`. The Gateway dependency is "
"immutable at runtime and credential files are not copied. SQLite data "
"remains in a named volume."
msgstr ""
"Compose supplies `../fnpqnn_gateway_MVP` as a named BuildKit context and "
"copies only its Python package into `/gateway`. The Gateway dependency is "
"immutable at runtime and credential files are not copied. SQLite data "
"remains in a named volume."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/gateway-troubleshooting.md:13
#: fd938f40d36245fe810c743a966e91dc
msgid ""
"For a direct build outside Compose, provide the same context explicitly:"
msgstr ""
"For a direct build outside Compose, provide the same context explicitly:"
